# Line-ending policy for the frontend (Agent C · hawk-eye/ui-integrity).
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"`. Without this file, Windows + core.autocrlf=true checks
# out CRLF, so `prettier --check` flags every file locally even though CI (Linux/LF) is green. Enforcing
# LF in git keeps the format gate consistent across every OS. After adding this, run once to normalize
# the working tree:  git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
